<title>GREECE: COMMERCIAL BANK EXPANDS PRESENCE IN RHODES.</title>
<headline>COMMERCIAL BANK EXPANDS PRESENCE IN RHODES.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Commercial Bank launched a new branch in Faliraki, Rhodes and a currency exchange in Lindos, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-13</p>
